-- The public lists built into the app (src/constants/presets.ts) are published online with
-- the same keys, beside the others: the app shows the online version of a key first
-- (useCatalog), so they are now edited here, without an app update, like the daily lists.
-- Same cards in the same order: same vote keys, the votes already cast still count. The
-- copies in the app stay as the offline fallback of a first launch. Not "mobile-games":
-- its cards take their App Store icon (appStoreIds), which this table can't hold.
-- Their translations stay the ones shipped in the app (content-i18n/, "builtin") until a list
-- is edited: its translation is then written in full in content_translations (kind template).

update public.templates set sort = sort + 19 where key in ('cities-fr', 'pastries', 'video-game-genres') and sort < 20;

on conflict (key) do nothing;
